    {
      "id": "claim_479a131d144b42179038738388373cb4",
      "statement": "The Swift Tracker API contract permits 250,000 calls per month (renewal 2027-01-31); usage was ~61% from GPI-C batch pulls plus Ops ad-hoc lookups, while per-payment lookups from client channels were estimated at ~1.9 million calls/month (~2,900 outbound international wires/day with repeated client views), exceeding the contract by ~7x, so any real-time design must use a change-feed with internal fan-out rather than per-payment calls.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/png-tdd-6.0-payment-network-gateway-fedwire-and-gpi-technical-design.md#L90-L92",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:418fb701c113b34af833ad1f207a2f37a37d75a14e8f2160bc6ddae8643bdf49:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_eea10f86b8a040e382b790c7797ea186",
      "statement": "A 2026 request (PNG-1544) to increase the gpi batch frequency from 4 hours to 2 hours was declined per Addendum A (2026-03-03) because projected Tracker API usage would exceed the contracted quota; a change-feed based internal service was recommended instead as a future initiative.",
      "evidence": [
