    {
      "id": "claim_4d04e4f6be4d4c748cad0da265605fbf",
      "statement": "Observed outbound gpi outcomes in Q3-2025 were: 88% reached final status ACCC, 8% ended tracking at ACSP/G001, 2.5% were pending over 24h (G002/G003/G004), 1.5% were RJCT, median release-to-ACCC was 2h41m, and 34% of wires had at least one intermediary deduction reported (SHAR/CRED).",
